  "cover_text": "John Cohen will be the producer of Rovios self financed record label, in association with Christian Chili and Terasal, the communications manager for Ellington Records as well as Distributing Manager of Intermedia Records.\nAriana Grande, Rahla Yamany Vadugiyala and Tina Turner will be named as the next engineers and arrangers for the project, while Boss Atlantic Records outside of the US will showcase Mike St. Pierre, Waverly Attiyag and Drew Olds with A.M. Vega as producers.\nKyte Fox and W. Chester Johnson will act as distributor for White Rock Records, in addition to Chris Burch who will act as shop supervisor and W. Chester Johnson will assist with the project.\n*Web site to be created for the project. Holder starts with a collaboration with Sgt Nation label leader personal producer Vali",
